; abnf stdio.tiff mutation (binary) — protocol::OpBinary: raw UTF-8 JSON bytes of
; TiffMutation (#[serde(tag = "mutation")]), NOT wrapped in the shared `.semio` envelope
; (contrast with ../../📸️snapshot/💾️binary/). No length prefix: the entire op body IS the
; JSON document; the "mutation" tag selects one of 8 real variants.
document    = json-object
json-object = *OCTET   ; UTF-8 JSON object per sibling ../📝️text/📖️component.grammar.semio
